{"version":1,"content":"<p>在高蛋白飲食越來越受到關注的背景下，研究人員近日對20種常見高蛋白食物進行了綜合評估，從營養健康、經濟可負擔性以及環境可持續性三個維度進行比較，希望找出真正兼顧個人健康與社會效益的優質蛋白來源。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586068.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.012723+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:04:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_hash":"f65542873e655557b513832ec51594456e00df357e379f3bc614f94af1b3c5ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}